# Model payloads are not committed.
#  - the Tiny set and the TTS models live in the `lib` submodule (lib/assets/models/...)
#  - the Whisper-Large-V3-Turbo QNN set is ~2.2 GB, far over GitHub's 100 MB per-file
#    limit; reconstruct it with tools/fetch_turbo_assets.py
#  - the LFM2 chat payload is ~0.4 GB
app/src/main/assets/models/
app/src/main/assets/chat/
